Modifications made in this derivative work:
- targeted macOS only; the Windows and Linux integrations were removed
- fixed the input source being switched to English when a window regained focus
- added the requirement that the focused editor be the currently selected one
- removed the "restore input source on re-entering insert mode" feature
- renamed the plugin identifier and Kotlin packages
- migrated the build to the IntelliJ Platform Gradle Plugin 2.x
- revised documentation

